{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>想用親民價錢享受豪華住宿？杜如風（Helen）在今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，就為大家開箱位於雪嶽山的 …</p><p></p>\n<p>想用親民價錢享受豪華住宿？杜如風（Helen）在今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，就為大家開箱位於雪嶽山的森林渡假村！這裡的住宿不但有玻璃屋頂設計，可以躺在床上看風景，價錢更僅需500多到1,000零元港幣，CP值極高，究竟有幾正？\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9064325f-306c-49fa-b754-7a433b78ba4f_18670230236afc5dbc25259-1024x576.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 2025年新聞的樹屋旅館！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9064325f-306c-49fa-b754-7a433b78ba4f_18670230236afc5dbc25259-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2025年新聞的樹屋旅館！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>玻璃屋頂樹屋露台 杜如風開箱雪嶽山無敵靚景住宿</h2>\n<p>杜如風今次開箱的「雪嶽山森林度假村」，最大特色是大部分住宿的屋頂均採用了玻璃設計，讓住客可以安躺床上或身處室內，就能欣賞到屋外的無敵靚景。其中一款「樹屋」的露台，更是欣賞冬天雪景的天花板級選擇。整個住宿空間夠大、夠新淨，而且充滿設計感，屋外盡是優美的自然美景，絕對是打卡首選。</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.foresttrip.go.kr/indvz/main.do?hmpgId=ID02030129\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">수락산 동막골자연휴양림</a>森林度假住宿</strong><br/>\n地址：首爾市蘆原區上溪洞9號</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/screenshot-2026-11-17-at-9.52.17pm_14529571636afc5c2060f6f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 航拍介紹影片，超過160 次瀏覽！（圖片來源：BLIMP ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1062\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/screenshot-2026-11-17-at-9.52.17pm_14529571636afc5c2060f6f.png\" width=\"858\"/></a><figcaption>航拍介紹影片，超過160 次瀏覽！（圖片來源：BLIMP ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>每晚僅500蚊起跳 杜如風揭超矜貴預訂規則</h2>\n<p>如此充滿設計感的森林系住宿，價錢卻相當親民，僅由500多到1,000零元港幣不等，CP值極高。不過，這間渡假村有一個非常特別的規定，就是每人每次只能預訂一晚，可見其相當矜貴和搶手。杜如風在節目中也對此感到驚訝，更凸顯了這間渡假村的獨特魅力，想體驗就要提早計劃了。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/e04aafdb-f1f6-4cc6-ab80-0f08d1830d19_12549910376afc5de16fad4-1024x576.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 極受歡迎！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/e04aafdb-f1f6-4cc6-ab80-0f08d1830d19_12549910376afc5de16fad4-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>極受歡迎！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民心心眼：呢間CP值太高！</h2>\n<p>渡假村的超高性價比和獨特設計，立即引起網民關注，不少人都表示非常心動。網民留言：「千幾蚊住到玻璃屋？仲要喺雪嶽山？即刻想訂！」、「每人只可以訂一晚咁串？肯定好搶手！」、「冬天去睇雪景一定好浪漫！」、「多謝Helen介紹，又多個住宿選擇！」、「呢啲先係真．嘆世界！」</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_874253996afbe2c4bbd26.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_874253996afbe2c4bbd26.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_12848739346afbe2c9b5c8c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_12848739346afbe2c9b5c8c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_16755132746afbe2ce2bd03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_16755132746afbe2ce2bd03.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DPi1Wj-kwQS/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">또떠남 ddoddunam（@ddoddunam）分享的貼文</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_4198184836afbe2d34d99d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_4198184836afbe2d34d99d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">杜如風</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e4%bd%8f%e5%ae%bf/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">韓國住宿</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544586\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T15:36:10.486504+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1171,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T13:50:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:51:05.953095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T15:29:34.233468+00:00","content_hash":"339749eba8bd5ed4a4b7b0d64e9a25fb87b05f40747f768ed04b1153557d3678","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}